+# Review Work Budget and Workspace Hardening Implementation Plan
+
+> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.
+
+**Goal:** Bound every untrusted review stage and make one marker-bearing workspace own all source, compiler, and analyzer artifacts through reliable cleanup.
+
+**Architecture:** A versioned immutable `ReviewWorkBudget` is the single source for intake, source, token, stage, subprocess, and cleanup limits. Pipeline stages use deterministic selection plus a real BPE tokenizer, compiler and SpotBugs use one bounded child-process runner, and GitHub preparation plus analyzer outputs share a marker-bearing workspace recovered by a restricted janitor.
+
+**Tech Stack:** Java 17, Spring Boot configuration properties, LangChain4j, jtokkit, Micrometer, JUnit 5, AssertJ, Maven, Docker Compose.
