+**Spec:** `/Users/yzy/Project/code-review-agent/.worktrees/github-app-review-loop/.superpowers/sdd/2026-09-01-github-app-review-loop/final-review.md` (C3, I3, Task 6 cleanup ruling, owned I5 pipeline slice)
